msgstr "Limites de requêtes Figma"

#: includes/integrations/figma/figma.php:254
msgid "Meanwhile: frames already pulled convert normally — NibWP builds them from its own cache without calling Figma."
msgstr "En attendant : les frames déjà importées se convertissent normalement — NibWP les construit à partir de son propre cache sans appeler Figma."

