msgstr "Aucun texte alternatif fourni. Décrivez l’image et rappelez attach_asset avec alt — une image sans alt est un défaut, pas un choix de style."

#. translators: %s: the error WordPress reported
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:151
#, php-format
msgid "That image could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Impossible de récupérer cette image : %s"

#. translators: %s: the error WordPress reported
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:176
#, php-format
msgid "That image could not be added to the Media Library: %s"
msgstr "Impossible d’ajouter cette image à la médiathèque : %s"

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:198
msgid "That data: URI is not a base64 image."
msgstr "Cette URI data: n’est pas une image en base64."

#. translators: %s: the mime type that was refused
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:209
#, php-format
msgid "\"%s\" is not an image type this site accepts inline. Use PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP or AVIF."
msgstr "« %s » n’est pas un type d’image que ce site accepte en ligne. Utilisez PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP ou AVIF."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:218
msgid "That data: URI does not decode."
msgstr "Cette URI data: ne se décode pas."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:221
msgid "That inline image is too large. Host it and send the URL instead."
msgstr "Cette image en ligne est trop volumineuse. Hébergez-la et envoyez plutôt l’URL."

#. translators: %s: the error WordPress reported
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:238
#, php-format
msgid "That image could not be written to the uploads directory: %s"
msgstr "Impossible d’écrire cette image dans le dossier uploads : %s"

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:239
msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "erreur inconnue"

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-assets.php:252
msgid "Those bytes are not the image type the data: URI claimed."
msgstr "Ces octets ne correspondent pas au type d’image annoncé par l’URI data:."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:115
msgid "Send the design as an object: design { name, source, tree | html | jsx, ... }. Read it out of Paper with your own MCP connection first."
msgstr "Envoyez le design sous forme d’objet : design { name, source, tree | html | jsx, ... }. Lisez-le d’abord dans Paper avec votre propre connexion MCP."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:124
msgid "That payload is not JSON-encodable, so it cannot be a design."
msgstr "Ce contenu ne peut pas être encodé en JSON, ce ne peut donc pas être un design."

#. translators: 1: payload size in bytes, 2: the limit in bytes
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:133
#, php-format
msgid "That payload is %1$d bytes and the limit is %2$d. Ingest one frame or section at a time."
msgstr "Ce contenu fait %1$d octets et la limite est de %2$d. Ingérez une frame ou une section à la fois."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:153
#: includes/integrations/paper/paper.php:1369
msgid "Paper design"
msgstr "Design Paper"

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:177
msgid "Nothing to read: give tree (a node array), html, or jsx. Paper can export any of the three."
msgstr "Rien à lire : fournissez tree (un tableau de nœuds), html ou jsx. Paper peut exporter les trois."

#. translators: %d: the node limit
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:190
#, php-format
msgid "That design has more than %d nodes. Ingest it one section at a time."
msgstr "Ce design a plus de %d nœuds. Ingérez-le une section à la fois."

#. translators: %d: the depth limit
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "That tree nests deeper than %d levels. Flatten it in Paper, or ingest an inner frame directly."
msgstr "Cet arbre dépasse %d niveaux d’imbrication. Aplatissez-le dans Paper, ou ingérez directement une frame intérieure."

#. translators: %s: the source kind that was sent
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:213
#, php-format
msgid "Nothing usable came out of the %s you sent — no node survived parsing. Check that you exported the frame and not an empty selection."
msgstr "Rien d’utilisable n’est sorti du %s envoyé — aucun nœud n’a survécu à l’analyse. Vérifiez que vous avez exporté la frame et pas une sélection vide."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:267
msgid "That payload contains a PHP open tag. Refused whole — a design has no reason to carry one."
msgstr "Ce contenu contient une balise d’ouverture PHP. Refusé en bloc — un design n’a aucune raison d’en contenir une."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:274
msgid "That payload contains a serialised PHP object. Refused whole — nothing here deserialises anything, and a design does not need it."
msgstr "Ce contenu contient un objet PHP sérialisé. Refusé en bloc — rien ici ne désérialise quoi que ce soit, et un design n’en a pas besoin."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:413
msgid "PHP has no DOM extension on this host, so html and jsx cannot be read. Send tree instead."
msgstr "PHP n’a pas l’extension DOM sur cet hébergement, html et jsx ne peuvent donc pas être lus. Envoyez plutôt tree."

#. translators: %s: an HTML tag name
#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:557
#, php-format
msgid "Dropped a \"%s\" element and everything inside it — markup that executes or loads is never part of a design."
msgstr "Un élément « %s » et tout son contenu ont été écartés — un balisage qui exécute ou charge quelque chose ne fait jamais partie d’un design."

#: includes/integrations/paper/class-paper-ingest.php:634
msgid "Ignored event-handler and script-carrying attributes on the markup. Only layout, text and image references are read."
