msgstr "Modification du statut de cet évènement"

#: includes/premium/integrations/eventprime.php:1372
msgid "A status of publish, draft, pending, private or future is required."
msgstr "Un statut publish, draft, pending, private ou future est requis."

#: includes/premium/integrations/eventprime.php:1378
