msgstr "Évènements sans date de début, ou avec un début local sans équivalent UTC. Aucun des deux n’apparaît dans le calendrier."

#: includes/premium/integrations/events.php:2621
msgid "Read and manage The Events Calendar. Events: list_events, get_event, create_event, update_event, set_event_status, trash_event, delete_event_permanently, list_occurrences. Venues: list_venues, get_venue, create_venue, update_venue, venue_events. Organizers: list_organizers, get_organizer, create_organizer, update_organizer, organizer_events. Terms: list_event_categories, list_event_tags, set_event_terms. Calendar: calendar_between, upcoming_events. And audit_calendar, which reports what is wrong with the calendar."
msgstr "Lisez et gérez The Events Calendar. Évènements : list_events, get_event, create_event, update_event, set_event_status, trash_event, delete_event_permanently, list_occurrences. Lieux : list_venues, get_venue, create_venue, update_venue, venue_events. Organisateurs : list_organizers, get_organizer, create_organizer, update_organizer, organizer_events. Termes : list_event_categories, list_event_tags, set_event_terms. Calendrier : calendar_between, upcoming_events. Et audit_calendar, qui indique ce qui ne va pas dans le calendrier."

