msgstr "Lecture d’un espace SureDash"

#: includes/premium/integrations/suredash.php:1436
msgid "Listing SureDash space groups"
msgstr "Liste des groupes d’espaces SureDash"

#: includes/premium/integrations/suredash.php:1540
